---
source: crates/safix/src/reporter.rs
expression: render_plain(&refusal)
---
safix: --direction is refused on the keepassxc target.

Only the clan target accepts --direction, because a keepassxc mapping
declares a mode rather than a direction, and a mode narrows a run by
being named rather than by a run-time flag. Drop --direction, or name
the clan target instead.
